<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-4963] Typo in spark/spark-scala-parent/pom.xml</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-4963</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There is a typo in current master version of file spark/spark-scala-parent/pom.xml&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-xml&quot;&gt;
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-tag&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;saprk.scala.compile.version&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;${spark.scala.binary.version}&lt;span class=&quot;code-tag&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;/saprk.scala.compile.version&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Permalink: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/ab47b29393757a0179fd276dc5fc4d790f3940ae/spark/spark-scala-parent/pom.xml#L40&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/ab47b29393757a0179fd276dc5fc4d790f3940ae/spark/spark-scala-parent/pom.xml#L40&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;And I think, that saprk should be replaced to spark.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It seems that this typo was added in the following issue/pr, and not affecting any release versions so far, fortunately.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Issue:&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3552&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3552&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
 PR:&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/3034&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/3034&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;m not sure whether this actually breaks something, so just set as minor priority.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
